Glass Home's launcher is a modified version of Hume Launcher
(https://github.com/petrobot-admin/hume-launcher), Copyright 2026 Petrobot, Apache License 2.0.
Changes: renamed and repackaged; the home screen, Control Centre, Search, title pages, Settings,
motion and materials were redesigned; the UK recommendations, the remote-buttons helper and the
screen saver were added.

This product includes third-party components under their own licences:

